{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23153","headline":"行简初授拾遗同早朝入合因示十二韵 · 白居易","name":"行简初授拾遗同早朝入合因示十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜色尚苍苍，槐阴夹路长。\n听钟出长乐，传鼓到新昌。\n宿雨沙堤润，秋风桦烛香。\n马骄欺地软，人健得天凉。\n待漏排阊阖，停珂拥建章。\n尔随黄合老，吾次紫微郎。\n并入连称籍，齐趋对折方。\n鬬班花接萼，绰立雁分行。\n近职诚爲美，微才岂合当。\n纶言难下笔，谏纸易盈箱。\n老去何侥幸，时来不料量。\n唯求杀身地，相誓荅恩光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}